// overnight X3 2026-11-12: E6 on corpus Recon_6_u_core_lpP_s2B (Stage-2 recipe B: NEW never-evaluated recipe: A + chain interleaving), node cafe1.
// Copy of runconfigs/twostage_lp/eval_20261110/E6_Recon_6_u_core_lpP_fv3.jsonc with ONLY: paths (testset_dir/results_dir/results_name), gem5.sample_fraction removed (full corpus), gem5.jobs 56, gem5.cache_setup random_all (per-test warm/cold/full where the build allows; cold is dropped on gem5-recon-ruby3 and gem5-spt), gem5.cache_setup_fill_bytes 65536 (the core-side L0D of this Ruby MESI_Three_Level config (--l0d_size=65536 in extra_args; cache_setup.fill_config refuses --l1d_size here because it is the second level)), sweep = the firstdet-final 3x3 timing_grid (unresolved 2500/5000/10000 x resolved 0/500/2500, one whole-test point per test), both branch modes. binary, config_script, scheme, extra_args (untaint/scheme flags), branch_ann_enable, fnc stall: unchanged from the validated config (protcheck K1b: E2/E3/E6 configs correct; E11 = the only correct SPT config).
// Stage-2 keys below are a provenance copy of stage2_fv4.jsonc; the final A/B Stage-2 keys are in stage2_final_{A,B}.jsonc (the run does not regenerate). Launch: scripts/overnight_20261111/launch_gem5.sh <node>.
{
  "paths": {
    "alloy_stage": "STAGE1_alloy",
    "models_dir": "STAGE1_alloy/models",
    "stage2_dir": "STAGE2_compilation",
